   <plugins><![CDATA[[PI Plugin1 Python "{"datasetVariables":[{"name":"teilenummer","value":2047,"unit":""}],"validation":"\"\"\"Die Ausgabe für die Werte aus dataset.py prüfen.\"\"\"\n\nimport unittest\n\nimport dataset\nfrom helpers import RedirectedStdout\n\n\ndef correct_implementation():\n    \"\"\"Die Ziffern einer Teilenummer von rechts nach links addieren.\"\"\"\n    teilenummer = int(dataset.teilenummer.value)\n    rest = teilenummer\n    quersumme = 0\n    while rest > 0:\n        letzte_ziffer = rest % 10\n        quersumme = quersumme + letzte_ziffer\n        rest = rest // 10\n    print(f'Quersumme: {quersumme}')\n\n\nclass Checker(unittest.TestCase):  # do not rename; plugin checks expect this name\n    def test_output(self):\n        with RedirectedStdout() as student_out:\n            import answer\n        with RedirectedStdout() as expected_out:\n            correct_implementation()\n        self.assertEqual(str(student_out), str(expected_out))\n","indication":"# Berechne die Quersumme mit einer while-Schleife, % und //.\n","files":{},"evalConfig":{"runAtTest":true,"lintAtTest":true},"linterConfig":"--disable=all --enable=F,E,W","linterWeight":0.5,"cpuTime":5,"formatterConfig":""}"]]]></plugins>
